<title>USA: Minnesota Mining launches new bandage.</title>
<headline>Minnesota Mining launches new bandage.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co said Wednesday it launched a new adhesive bandage, 3M Clean Seals Superior Waterproof Protection Bandages.</p>
<p>The bandage protects the injured skin by sealing around the pad to block out water, dirt and germs, 3M said.</p>
<p>3M Clean Seals are available in five package selections, including all one size, assorted sizes and small, medium and large size dressings.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
